- I don't know what you're talking about.
- I know you. Anyone but him.


01:11:42.326 --> 01:11:43.535
Promise me.


01:11:45.120 --> 01:11:46.204
Okay.


01:11:46.747 --> 01:11:48.081
- Okay?
- Okay.


01:11:49.291 --> 01:11:50.375
Yeah.


01:11:50.667 --> 01:11:51.835
I don't know.


01:11:53.712 --> 01:11:54.713
Okay.


01:11:55.589 --> 01:11:57.215
Okay, okay, okay.


01:11:57.215 --> 01:11:58.967
I've never been here before.


01:12:02.429 --> 01:12:05.891
- You have me. You have all of me.
- I know. I know. I know.


01:12:05.891 --> 01:12:08.560
- So, if I'm not what you want, you just...
- No, no, no. You're fine.


01:12:08.560 --> 01:12:10.145
Stop. Stop. Stop.


01:12:10.979 --> 01:12:12.481
Stop. Stop. Stop.


01:12:12.981 --> 01:12:14.816
Stop. Stop.


01:12:15.651 --> 01:12:17.319
- Stop.
- I love you, Lily.


01:12:17.319 --> 01:12:19.988
I know. I know. I know. I know.


01:12:20.656 --> 01:12:21.990
I know.


01:12:23.575 --> 01:12:24.660
I love you, Lily.


01:12:27.329 --> 01:12:28.497
I love you, too.


01:12:37.214 --> 01:12:39.633
No, please stop. No, please, please.


01:12:39.633 --> 01:12:41.843
Lily! Open the door.


01:12:42.427 --> 01:12:43.804
- You gotta leave right now.
- Lily!


01:12:43.804 --> 01:12:45.264
- I'm coming!
- Open the door!


01:12:45.264 --> 01:12:47.391
- Leave right now. Put your clothes on.
- Who's in there?


01:12:47.391 --> 01:12:49.184
- He's coming. Come on.
- Hey! Open...


01:13:24.678 --> 01:13:26.763
- Thank you. Enjoy.
- Thank you for coming by.


01:13:26.763 --> 01:13:27.848
We appreciate it.


01:13:28.599 --> 01:13:29.808
- Bye.
- Thank you.


01:13:29.808 --> 01:13:31.143
Thanks so much for stopping in.


01:13:31.143 --> 01:13:32.519
- It's busy.
- Yeah.


01:13:36.523 --> 01:13:37.691
I think that's the last of it.


01:13:38.066 --> 01:13:39.067
How you doing, mama?


01:13:39.067 --> 01:13:40.736
I'm doing.


01:13:42.362 --> 01:13:44.323
- I'm doing.
- You in that little dress.


01:13:44.323 --> 01:13:45.407
Do you mind if I...


01:13:46.241 --> 01:13:49.119
- If I see the baby for a moment?
- Oh, yeah. Have a visit.


01:13:49.119 --> 01:13:51.622
Hi, bubba. How you doing? You getting big.


01:13:52.122 --> 01:13:53.123
Hey, question.


01:13:53.916 --> 01:13:57.044
If we're not allowed
to go back to that restaurant...


01:13:57.044 --> 01:13:58.128
Yeah.


01:13:58.128 --> 01:14:01.465
...why is he allowed to
come to this store?


01:14:07.262 --> 01:14:08.597
- I don't...
- Coffee.


01:14:08.597 --> 01:14:11.516
- Okay.
- I'm getting coffee. Would you like some?


01:14:12.267 --> 01:14:14.061
No, I'm good. Thank you.


01:14:14.061 --> 01:14:16.521
- Excuse me. Hi. Hey. Excuse me.
- Hi.


01:14:17.481 --> 01:14:18.523
Thank you.


01:14:18.523 --> 01:14:20.192
- Nice to see you.
- Yeah.


01:14:23.570 --> 01:14:24.571
Hi.


01:14:25.906 --> 01:14:26.907
Hi.


01:14:27.699 --> 01:14:29.701
This is incredible.


01:14:29.993 --> 01:14:31.078
Yeah, thanks.


01:14:31.078 --> 01:14:33.497
Kind of exactly how I imagined it.


01:14:36.124 --> 01:14:37.125
Yeah, yours too.


01:14:38.335 --> 01:14:39.336
Thanks.


01:14:40.837 --> 01:14:41.922
Look at us.


01:14:45.133 --> 01:14:46.385
So, look, I...


01:14:49.096 --> 01:14:51.181
I came by the next day after the fight,


01:14:53.100 --> 01:14:56.645
but he was here. And I... I just didn't think
that was a good idea.


01:14:58.522 --> 01:15:00.566
I just... I just wanted to say I'm really sorry.


01:15:00.566 --> 01:15:03.402
- I was out of my mind...
- Yeah.


01:15:03.402 --> 01:15:05.153
...and... and acted like a jackass and...


01:15:05.153 --> 01:15:07.072
I just feel really bad and I'm sorry.


01:15:07.072 --> 01:15:09.074
Yeah, yeah. No, it's all good. It's...


01:15:09.783 --> 01:15:11.910
Yeah. It was a misunderstanding. So...


01:15:11.910 --> 01:15:14.663
Well, I don't... I don't know. I mean, no, it wasn't.


01:15:15.163 --> 01:15:16.331
I don't think it was.


01:15:21.461 --> 01:15:23.964
Why are you here now?
I gave you my address months ago.


01:15:23.964 --> 01:15:25.340
What are you... What are you doing?


01:15:25.340 --> 01:15:26.675
I came the next day.


01:15:33.765 --> 01:15:36.518
I drive this street a lot.


01:15:44.902 --> 01:15:45.903
Yeah.


01:15:52.200 --> 01:15:53.619
I'm sorry.


01:15:57.664 --> 01:15:58.832
Are you happy?


01:16:01.793 --> 01:16:02.836
Yeah.


01:16:04.713 --> 01:16:06.131
- Yeah?
- Yeah.


01:16:06.798 --> 01:16:08.216
I couldn't be happier.


01:16:10.510 --> 01:16:11.511
Are you?


01:16:15.098 --> 01:16:16.224
No.


01:16:21.355 --> 01:16:22.439
Sorry.


01:16:35.577 --> 01:16:36.745
That your phone?


01:16:36.745 --> 01:16:37.829
Yeah.


01:16:40.540 --> 01:16:41.541
What are you doing?


01:16:47.172 --> 01:16:49.841
That's my number. In case you need it.


01:16:53.595 --> 01:16:55.430
Okay, well, I won't, so...


01:16:56.515 --> 01:16:57.683
But thank you.


01:16:57.683 --> 01:16:58.850
I hope you don't.


01:17:08.652 --> 01:17:09.903
Hey, that...


01:17:10.737 --> 01:17:12.531
That thing that he said about that...


01:17:12.531 --> 01:17:14.283
You know, with us. It wasn't...


01:17:15.534 --> 01:17:16.535
<i>It wasn't wasted.</i>


01:17:17.703 --> 01:17:19.079
I know.


01:17:21.331 --> 01:17:22.332
I was there.


01:17:38.015 --> 01:17:39.016
Hi.


01:17:44.563 --> 01:17:45.981
- Hey.
- Hey.


01:17:51.862 --> 01:17:53.447
That smells good.


01:17:53.447 --> 01:17:54.615
Thank you.


01:17:59.202 --> 01:18:00.579
Are you happy?


01:18:06.084 --> 01:18:07.169
Are you okay?


01:18:08.295 --> 01:18:09.546
Yeah. I'm just...


01:18:10.172 --> 01:18:11.590
I'm just curious.


01:18:16.345 --> 01:18:17.512
I wasn't.


01:18:19.765 --> 01:18:21.391
Lily, you make me happy.


01:18:22.893 --> 01:18:23.894
Are you happy?


01:18:25.145 --> 01:18:28.315
I mean, I don't think anyone's
happy all the time, but...


01:18:29.524 --> 01:18:31.276
I don't know if I like the sound of that.


01:18:31.276 --> 01:18:32.903
No, no. It's just, you know...


01:18:32.903 --> 01:18:36.365
Of course I deal with, you know, my stuff


01:18:36.365 --> 01:18:41.119
and, you know, life, and ticking clock


01:18:41.119 --> 01:18:43.288
- and, you know, all those decisions that...
- Right.


01:18:43.288 --> 01:18:45.582
that women have to worry about.


01:18:45.582 --> 01:18:48.252
But, I think I'm an innately happy person.


01:18:48.252 --> 01:18:53.215
It's probably just a coping mechanism
I learned from my mom. So...


01:18:53.215 --> 01:18:54.299
Your mom?


01:18:57.636 --> 01:18:59.388
My dad used to hit her.


01:19:09.231 --> 01:19:11.066
Shit, I'm so sorry.


01:19:12.442 --> 01:19:13.777
You never told me that.


01:19:15.362 --> 01:19:17.447
That's not something people talk about.


01:19:18.782 --> 01:19:20.200
Did he ever hurt you?


01:19:21.535 --> 01:19:24.162
No. He nearly killed Atlas though.


01:19:29.876 --> 01:19:31.628
Oh, my God. I'm so sorry.


01:19:36.216 --> 01:19:37.676
Oh, God.


01:19:40.053 --> 01:19:41.555
I'm so embarrassed. I...


01:19:42.639 --> 01:19:44.391
That mess at the restaurant.


01:19:46.602 --> 01:19:48.687
I didn't know.
That must have been so hard on you.


01:19:48.687 --> 01:19:49.771
Yeah.


01:19:50.981 --> 01:19:53.066
Baby, all I wanna do in my life
is protect you.


01:19:53.066 --> 01:19:54.234
You know that, right?


01:19:54.902 --> 01:19:57.154
When you hurt yourself by accident,


01:19:58.488 --> 01:20:00.198
when you stub your toe, I blame myself.


01:20:00.198 --> 01:20:03.744
It's like it's my fault
that the wall was there.


01:20:03.744 --> 01:20:04.828
Stop.


01:20:04.828 --> 01:20:07.289
I'm the luckiest goddamn man
on this planet.


01:20:10.000 --> 01:20:12.169
And I could clean up. Trust me.


01:20:12.169 --> 01:20:14.004
Okay. I'm not trying to hear about that.


01:20:14.004 --> 01:20:16.924
- You don't wanna hear about that? Just a little bit?
- No. No.


01:20:17.716 --> 01:20:19.968
Yeah, I'm a ripped neurosurgeon
for Christ's sake.


01:20:19.968 --> 01:20:21.845
When was the last time
you saw someone who looked like me


01:20:21.845 --> 01:20:23.639
that wasn't on a daytime soap?


01:20:23.639 --> 01:20:26.516
I mean, come to think of it,
yeah, I... No, I haven't.


01:20:26.516 --> 01:20:28.185
- Yeah.
- And I'm rich.


01:20:28.644 --> 01:20:29.895
And humble.


01:20:32.230 --> 01:20:33.649
We can work on that.


01:20:34.608 --> 01:20:36.026
God, I love you.


01:20:36.610 --> 01:20:39.613
I know. I love you too.
That's the problem.


01:20:41.573 --> 01:20:42.866
<i>It's a big problem.</i>


01:20:44.076 --> 01:20:45.702
<i>It's a really big problem.</i>


01:21:06.473 --> 01:21:07.474
Stop.


01:21:15.399 --> 01:21:17.818
Look at her. She's like a little alien.


01:21:18.443 --> 01:21:20.988
Yeah, she's perfect.


01:21:25.117 --> 01:21:26.243
Do you want to hold her?


01:21:28.537 --> 01:21:30.664
- Yeah.
- I knew it.


01:21:30.664 --> 01:21:31.957
Here you go.


01:21:31.957 --> 01:21:33.125
Okay.


01:21:35.002 --> 01:21:37.629
- Hi.
- There we go. Right there.


01:21:37.754 --> 01:21:41.341
- You're so beautiful. Hi.
- Wow.


01:21:41.341 --> 01:21:42.593
You're a mama.


01:21:42.593 --> 01:21:43.927
Yeah.


01:21:43.927 --> 01:21:45.804
My sister's a mama.


01:21:45.804 --> 01:21:47.222
And you're an uncle.


01:21:53.061 --> 01:21:55.188
Wow. You did it.


01:21:56.982 --> 01:21:59.318
This is just hormones. Don't look at me.


01:22:00.360 --> 01:22:02.154
Do you guys want kids? Well...


01:22:02.154 --> 01:22:04.781
- No pressure. We're not...
- I'm putting you on the spot right now.


01:22:04.781 --> 01:22:07.701
I mean, it would be great
for childcare and stuff like that.


01:22:08.952 --> 01:22:11.413
I'm not gonna make her
put on a white dress


01:22:11.413 --> 01:22:12.831
and have my babies.


01:22:14.082 --> 01:22:15.709
Unless she wants to.


01:22:17.419 --> 01:22:19.046
Then I would marry her tonight.


01:22:24.676 --> 01:22:26.136
- Oh, shit. He's serious.
- Oh, my gosh.


01:22:26.136 --> 01:22:28.847
Ryle, you are...
You're drunk on baby smell.


01:22:28.847 --> 01:22:30.724
No, no, no. I am serious as an aneurysm.


01:22:30.724 --> 01:22:33.560
Oh, God. Please don't do
neurosurgeon humour when you're propos...


01:22:33.560 --> 01:22:34.645
I mean, if you are.


01:22:34.645 --> 01:22:36.021
Is that... Is this...


01:22:36.021 --> 01:22:37.856
- He's going around.
- I mean, if that's what you...


01:22:37.856 --> 01:22:39.524
- Give me the baby.
- This is out of it...


01:22:39.524 --> 01:22:41.026
- Please stop.
- Yeah. Wait.


01:22:41.026 --> 01:22:42.819
No, no. No, no, stop.


01:22:42.819 --> 01:22:44.988
- He's doing it?
- Oh, my God. Oh, my God.


01:22:44.988 --> 01:22:46.782
Okay. Okay. What...


01:22:48.367 --> 01:22:49.409
Can we just...


01:22:50.118 --> 01:22:51.745
Can you get the baby? We have a baby.


01:22:51.745 --> 01:22:53.038
- We can take that. That's ours.
- Give me.


01:22:53.038 --> 01:22:54.748
- Here you go.
- Here you go, baby.


01:22:54.748 --> 01:22:57.709
You get back down there.
You get back down there right this second.


01:23:04.633 --> 01:23:06.468
Will you marry me, Lily Blossom Bloom?


01:23:09.888 --> 01:23:10.889
Yeah?


01:23:10.889 --> 01:23:12.057
Okay.


01:23:12.057 --> 01:23:14.810
- This is just... I'm just...
- He did it.


01:23:14.810 --> 01:23:16.395
This is a miracle.


01:23:17.229 --> 01:23:18.230
Oh, thank God.


01:23:19.064 --> 01:23:20.399
Oh, my God.


01:23:29.658 --> 01:23:32.369
<i>- But we'll do a proper wedding one day.
- You got married without me.</i>


01:23:32.369 --> 01:23:34.746
And I continue to be very sorry,


01:23:34.746 --> 01:23:36.623
but at some point
you're gonna have to forgive me.


01:23:36.623 --> 01:23:38.041
I will wear you down.


01:23:38.041 --> 01:23:39.960
<i>- My wife will wear you down.
- Not possible.</i>


01:23:39.960 --> 01:23:42.170
I don't think you should ever forgive her.
Just saying.


01:23:42.170 --> 01:23:44.715
Okay. That's enough of that.
Hold on, can you charge my phone?


01:23:44.715 --> 01:23:47.509
<i>I haven't been dreaming about
your wedding day your whole life,</i>


01:23:47.509 --> 01:23:49.219
<i>I've been dreaming about it my whole life.</i>


01:23:49.219 --> 01:23:51.555
<i>And I'm sorry, I just feel cheated.</i>


01:23:51.555 --> 01:23:54.766
Yeah, okay. Got it. Thanks, Mom.
Okay, we're gonna find a way to move on.


01:23:54.766 --> 01:23:56.768
<i>If I don't get to watch you
walk down the aisle,</i>


01:23:56.768 --> 01:23:59.187
<i>I will not be denied watching you squirm.</i>


01:23:59.187 --> 01:24:01.523
<i>- You wanna make it up to me?
- Yes, please.</i>


01:24:01.523 --> 01:24:04.943
<i>Make me a grandbaby. No, three. Three.
Make it triplets.</i>


01:24:04.943 --> 01:24:08.280
All right, can you just... Can we move past
this conversation, please?


01:24:10.532 --> 01:24:11.533
You okay?


01:24:12.743 --> 01:24:13.744
<i>What happened?</i>


01:24:14.286 --> 01:24:16.163
<i>- Mom, I'll call you right back, okay?
- Okay.</i>


01:24:16.163 --> 01:24:17.247
Yeah, no, hang up.


01:24:20.292 --> 01:24:21.460
Hey, what happened?


01:24:26.506 --> 01:24:27.674
Hey, you okay?


01:24:34.431 --> 01:24:35.849
I dropped your phone,


01:24:38.226 --> 01:24:39.853
and the case fell off.


01:24:51.114 --> 01:24:52.366
And I found this.


01:24:58.872 --> 01:25:00.290
I called the number...


01:25:11.426 --> 01:25:13.345
- It wasn't...
- You promised me.


01:25:14.096 --> 01:25:15.931
- I know.
- I would never lie to you.


01:25:15.931 --> 01:25:17.224
I know. It's nothing.


01:25:17.224 --> 01:25:19.309
- It's nothing?
- Yeah.


01:25:19.851 --> 01:25:20.978
Yeah.


01:25:21.144 --> 01:25:23.814
- It's nothing?
- Yes. Yes, I promise.


01:25:24.564 --> 01:25:25.857
Yeah.


01:25:28.694 --> 01:25:29.695
Okay?


01:25:38.078 --> 01:25:39.079
It's nothing.


01:25:40.080 --> 01:25:42.332
- Okay.
- Okay.


01:25:50.340 --> 01:25:51.341
Ryle.


01:25:52.092 --> 01:25:54.761
Ryle, baby, I promise
I didn't mean to see him.


01:25:54.761 --> 01:25:56.680
- I promise. Please.
- Stop! No, no, no.


01:25:56.680 --> 01:25:58.348
- No. I promise, please.
- Lily, stop!


01:25:58.348 --> 01:26:00.100
No, it's... Please, just listen to me.


01:26:00.100 --> 01:26:02.561
- Please. I didn't know he was coming.
- You promised me, Lily. Stop.


01:26:02.561 --> 01:26:04.313
- Just talk to me. Please. Just...
- Stop!


01:26:04.313 --> 01:26:06.440
- You stop. Please. Don't...
- Stop!


01:26:12.863 --> 01:26:14.781
Hey. Just try to be still.


01:26:15.782 --> 01:26:16.783
Just try to be still.


01:26:20.787 --> 01:26:22.289
It's all done. I'm here.


01:26:22.289 --> 01:26:23.540
- Stop.
- I'm here.


01:26:24.291 --> 01:26:25.375
Hey.


01:26:25.375 --> 01:26:28.045
What... What happened?


01:26:29.046 --> 01:26:30.797
You fell down the stairs.


01:26:32.966 --> 01:26:34.885
No, no, no. Don't... Don't touch it.


01:26:35.761 --> 01:26:37.638
Yeah, you tripped and...


01:26:38.180 --> 01:26:40.849
And I... I... I tried to catch you.


01:26:40.849 --> 01:26:43.477
- No, Ryle, no.
- You're... You're okay. You're okay.


01:26:46.480 --> 01:26:47.564
- Don't.
- It hurts.


01:26:47.564 --> 01:26:49.066
I know it hurts. You're okay.


01:26:49.066 --> 01:26:50.651
- Okay.
- You're okay.


01:26:53.237 --> 01:26:54.571
Do you know who you are?


01:26:55.489 --> 01:26:56.823
Lily Bloom.


01:26:56.823 --> 01:26:58.200
Okay. Where are you?


01:26:59.243 --> 01:27:00.994
- Our apartment.
- Okay. Who am I?


01:27:02.579 --> 01:27:03.914
My husband.


01:27:05.499 --> 01:27:06.959
And what am I doing right now?


01:27:08.252 --> 01:27:09.586
Helping me.


01:27:12.506 --> 01:27:14.258
How many fingers am I holding up?


01:27:16.593 --> 01:27:17.594
- Five.
- Five.


01:27:17.594 --> 01:27:19.680
- And now? Okay.
- Two.


01:27:20.264 --> 01:27:21.682
Tell me it's nothing.


01:27:25.686 --> 01:27:26.979
It's nothing.


01:27:28.897 --> 01:27:29.940
Yeah, come.


01:27:31.733 --> 01:27:33.026
Thank you.


01:27:37.781 --> 01:27:38.782
Am I okay?


01:27:38.782 --> 01:27:40.367
You're okay. You're okay.


01:27:40.993 --> 01:27:42.077
Okay.


01:28:33.003 --> 01:28:34.421
Lily! Oh, my God.


01:28:34.421 --> 01:28:36.757
Did you see it? Did you see the magazine?


01:28:36.757 --> 01:28:38.550
You did it! Look at this!


01:28:38.550 --> 01:28:40.385
Top ten. We're in the top ten!


01:28:40.385 --> 01:28:42.638
- We're in the top... You did it.
- Wait, where is it?


01:28:42.638 --> 01:28:44.932
Where's the genius? Right there.
Look, look, look.


01:28:44.932 --> 01:28:46.266
- Right there. There's you!
- Oh, my God.


01:28:46.266 --> 01:28:47.935
Oh, my God. I'm gonna call Ryle


01:28:47.935 --> 01:28:50.687
and then tell him
to get, like, 50 copies of this thing.


01:29:21.093 --> 01:29:22.094
Hey.


01:29:23.053 --> 01:29:24.054
Hey.


01:29:31.728 --> 01:29:32.729
You saw?


01:29:34.398 --> 01:29:36.316
- Congratulations.
- Yeah, thank you.


01:29:36.316 --> 01:29:39.820
I didn't know it was a big deal,
"Best in Boston."


01:29:39.820 --> 01:29:41.238
Best in Boston.


01:29:47.744 --> 01:29:48.787
Hello.


01:29:51.039 --> 01:29:52.207
Okay.


01:29:56.628 --> 01:29:57.963
I love this tattoo.


